  "_comment": "E5 increment 4 (seq-10) — compile_claims manifest for the two E31C cure rules. Both bind to the inc4 ledger's claims (CL-E31C-02 marriage-registration requirement, CL-E31C-03 WNI-parent sponsor) and pass the compiler's four hard lints (VERIFIED-only, overstay-planning, unsatisfiable-condition, vacuous-rule/duplicate-subtree + must_reference_facts). The el.c2.corporate-sponsor-type retirement has no manifest entry by design: a retirement is not a compiled rule (el.e33e.deposit-income-basis precedent), and CF-17 records why no C2 tightening claim exists. fold_pack_seq10.py compiles this manifest with the inc4 ledger added to the standing ledger list, then (a) applies el.e31c-mixed-marriage-parents as an in-place EDIT (asserting the compiled body differs from seq-9 ONLY in when/required_facts) and (b) inserts hf.e31c-marriage-not-registered as a new rule.",
